#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_title"
msgid "Trickplay"
msgstr "Trickplay"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_summary"
msgid "Preview images for seeking"
msgstr "Förhandsvisningsbilder vid sökning"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_section_trickplay_processing"
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "Bearbetning"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_hw_decoding"
msgid "Enable hardware decoding"
msgstr "Aktivera maskinvaruavkodning"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_hw_encoding"
msgid "Enable hardware accelerated MJPEG encoding"
msgstr "Aktivera maskinvaruaccelererad MJPEG-kodning"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_hw_encoding_summary"
msgid ""
"Currently only available on QSV, VA-API, VideoToolbox and RKMPP, this option"
" has no effect on other hardware acceleration methods."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande tillgängligt endast för QSV, VA-API, VideoToolbox och RKMPP. "
"Alternativet påverkar inte andra metoder för maskinvaruacceleration."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_key_frames"
msgid "Only generate images from key frames"
msgstr "Generera endast bilder från nyckelrutor"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_key_frames_summary"
msgid ""
"Extract key frames only for significantly faster processing with less "
"accurate timing. If the configured hardware decoder does not support this "
"mode, will use the software decoder instead."
msgstr ""
"Extrahera endast nyckelrutor för betydligt snabbare bearbetning med mindre "
"exakt tidsangivelse. Om den valda maskinvaruavkodaren inte stöder läget "
"används programvaruavkodaren i stället."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_scan_behavior"
msgid "Scan Behavior"
msgstr "Skanningsbeteende"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_scan_behavior_summary"
msgid ""
"The default behavior is non blocking, which will add media to the library "
"before trickplay generation is done. Blocking will ensure trickplay files "
"are generated before media is added to the library, but will make scans "
"significantly longer."
msgstr ""
"Standardbeteendet blockerar inte och lägger till media i biblioteket innan "
"Trickplay-genereringen är klar. Blockering säkerställer att Trickplay-filer "
"skapas innan media läggs till i biblioteket, men gör skanningar betydligt "
"långsammare."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_scan_non_blocking"
msgid "Non Blocking - queues generation, then returns"
msgstr "Icke-blockerande – köar generering och återgår"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_scan_blocking"
msgid "Blocking - queues generation, blocks scan until complete"
msgstr ""
"Blockerande – köar generering och blockerar skanningen tills den är klar"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_priority"
msgid "Process Priority"
msgstr "Processprioritet"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_priority_summary"
msgid ""
"Setting this lower or higher will determine how the CPU prioritizes the "
"ffmpeg trickplay generation process in relation to other processes. If you "
"notice slowdown while generating trickplay images but don't want to fully "
"stop their generation, try lowering this as well as the thread count."
msgstr ""
"Ett lägre eller högre värde avgör hur processorn prioriterar ffmpegs "
"Trickplay-generering i förhållande till andra processer. Om datorn blir "
"långsam när Trickplay-bilder skapas men du inte vill stoppa genereringen "
"helt kan du sänka detta och antalet trådar."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_priority_high"
msgid "High"
msgstr "Hög"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_priority_above_normal"
msgid "Above normal"
msgstr "Över normal"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_priority_normal"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normal"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_priority_below_normal"
msgid "Below normal"
msgstr "Under normal"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_priority_idle"
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "Inaktiv"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_threads"
msgid "FFmpeg Threads"
msgstr "FFmpeg-trådar"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_threads_summary"
msgid "The number of threads to pass to the '-threads' argument of ffmpeg."
msgstr "Antalet trådar som skickas till ffmpegs argument ”-threads”."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_section_trickplay_images"
msgid "Images"
msgstr "Bilder"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_interval"
msgid "Image Interval"
msgstr "Bildintervall"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_interval_summary"
msgid "Interval of time (ms) between each new trickplay image."
msgstr "Tidsintervall i ms mellan varje ny Trickplay-bild."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_widths"
msgid "Width Resolutions"
msgstr "Breddupplösningar"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_widths_summary"
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of the widths (px) that trickplay images will be "
"generated at. All images should generate proportionally to the source, so a "
"width of 320 on a 16:9 video ends up around 320x180."
msgstr ""
"Kommaseparerad lista över bredder i pixlar som Trickplay-bilder skapas i. "
"Alla bilder ska skalas proportionellt mot källan, så bredden 320 för en "
"video i 16:9 blir ungefär 320×180."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_tile_width"
msgid "Tile Width"
msgstr "Rutbredd"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_tile_width_summary"
msgid "Maximum number of images per tile in the X direction."
msgstr "Högsta antal bilder per ruta i X-riktningen."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_tile_height"
msgid "Tile Height"
msgstr "Ruthöjd"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_tile_height_summary"
msgid "Maximum number of images per tile in the Y direction."
msgstr "Högsta antal bilder per ruta i Y-riktningen."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_qscale"
msgid "Qscale"
msgstr "Qscale"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_qscale_summary"
msgid ""
"The quality scale of images output by ffmpeg, with 2 being the highest "
"quality and 31 being the lowest."
msgstr ""
"Kvalitetsskalan för bilder som ffmpeg skapar; 2 är högsta kvalitet och 31 "
"lägsta."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_jpeg_quality"
msgid "JPEG Quality"
msgstr "JPEG-kvalitet"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_trickplay_jpeg_quality_summary"
msgid "The JPEG compression quality for trickplay images."
msgstr "JPEG-komprimeringens kvalitet för Trickplay-bilder."

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_show_advanced"
msgid "Show advanced settings"
msgstr "Visa avancerade inställningar"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_none"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ingen"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_auto"
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automatiskt"

#, java-printf-format
msgctxt "config_max"
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Maximalt"
